# Arrow functions

Write TypeScript functions as arrows, including exports and helpers.

```typescript
import type { GenerateContext } from "@deterministic-code/generators-common/generate-context";

export const generate = async (
  ctx: GenerateContext,
): Promise<GenerateEntry[]> => {
  // ...
};
```

Do not use `function` declarations (`function foo()` / `export async function foo()`). Methods on classes may stay method syntax. Do not rewrite generated app templates unless they are pack-owned generator source.
